  "translation": "Today is Xiao Ming's birthday. I want to give him a gift. My friend and I go to the mall together. We first go to the clothes store upstairs. There are many nice shirts in the store. I choose a blue one. My friend asks, 'What did you buy?' I answer, 'A shirt.' My friend says this one is too good. I also look at a pair of pants, but they are too expensive, so I don't buy them. Finally I buy that shirt. My friend also says he will buy one. Then we come down from upstairs and go to the bookstore downstairs. Xiao Ming likes reading, so I also buy a book. This book is very interesting. We are all very happy. In the afternoon we go home."
